  "_doc": {
    "what": "Malmö stad's 14 geografiska statistikområden, as the delområden each one contains.",
    "why": "The city's own answer to the question areas/areas.json asks by hand: what sits between a stadsdel and a delområde. The names are unusable on a map (\"Ribersborg, Bellevue m fl\"), but the *groupings* are official, so they are worth checking the curated ones against. test/areas.test.mjs does that.",
    "how": "Derived once by point-in-polygon: each delområde's interior point against the GeSO polygons. All 136 landed in exactly one, none in none.",
    "source": "https://opendata.malmo.se/ — dataset \"Geografiska statistikområden\" (ny indelning från 2022), resource geso_epsg_4326.json, CC0.",
    "fetched": "2026-07-26",
    "note": "A grouping spanning two of these is not automatically wrong — this division is statistical, not vernacular — but it is always worth a look. Known and accepted: Slottsstaden (Malmö Hus), Sorgenfri (Norra Sorgenfri)."
